      "summary": "parked on 1 decision (scope)",
      "quoted": {
        "text": "## Question\nShould a status change inside the minute be dropped, or scheduled for the minute’s end?\n\n## Options\n- **A: drop it** simpler. Costs: a wake-up can be lost.\n- **B: schedule one tick at the minute’s end** Costs: a timer per repository.\n\n## Recommended\nB, because no wake-up should be lost",
        "format": "markdown",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "record": {
        "kind": "review-thread",
        "id": "PRRT_kwDOc2",
        "url": "https://github.com/jig-harness/jig/pull/469#discussion_r2011"
      },
      "decision": {
        "key": "PRRT_kwDOc2",
        "class": "scope"
      },
      "via": "drive@jig#469"
    },
